              "standing": 1
            },
            "notes": "連 C8；張子駿應承親自同你排戲"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C_tsijun_push2_variety",
          "label": "揀綜藝大騷，同張子駿講聲抱歉",
          "effects": {
            "flags": [
              "flag_tsijun_push2_variety"
            ],
            "stats": {
              "standing": -1
            },
            "notes": "連 C8；張子駿冇鬧你，只叫你記住今日個選擇"
          }
        }
      ],
      "flags_written": [
        "flag_tsijun_push2_film",
        "flag_tsijun_push2_variety"
      ],
